      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>NEXUS OS — NEXUS OS</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#0d1117;color:#c9d1d9;\nfont:16px/1.65 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Inter,sans-serif}\n.w{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:56px 24px 96px}\nh1{font-size:26px;margin:0 0 6px;color:#f0f6fc}\nh2{font-size:17px;margin:32px 0 8px;color:#f0f6fc}\n.sub{color:#8b949e;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 32px}\na{color:#58a6ff}ul{padding-left:20px}li{margin:6px 0}\n.box{border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:8px;padding:16px;margin:24px 0;background:#161b22}\nfooter{margin-top:48px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #21262d;color:#8b949e;font-size:13px}</style></head><body><div class=\"w\">\n<h1>NEXUS OS</h1>\n<p class=\"sub\">Lead routing, customer messaging and compliance automation for a single automotive dealership.</p>\n<p>NEXUS OS answers dealership enquiries as they arrive, scores and routes them to\nthe right salesperson, keeps vehicle and customer records in step across the\ndealership's systems, and files the compliance evidence a vehicle sale requires.</p>\n<h2>What it connects to</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Gmail</b> — sends the dealership's own follow-up and escalation email from the dealership's own address.</li>\n<li><b>WhatsApp</b> — the channel customers actually use to ask about cars.</li>\n<li><b>Slack</b> — where a hot lead is put in front of a salesperson.</li>\n<li><b>Supabase</b> — leads, inventory and message history.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Who it is for</h2>\n<p>This is internal software for one dealership. It is not offered to the public\nand has no sign-up. The only Google account it ever touches is the dealership\nowner's own, connected by that owner.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/webhook/privacy\">Privacy policy</a> · <a href=\"/webhook/terms\">Terms of service</a></p><footer>NEXUS OS — automotive dealership operations. Contact: aliasgher892@gmail.com</footer></div></body></html>",
